      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IBROX REIGN (3) hasn't been far away, finishing in the money twice in a row including last time in a Grade 5 at this track over 388m. This looks easier and expected to bounce back. TARAWI REX (8) crossed over from out wide but caught the leaders turning before drawing clear to score (22.22) at this track in a Grade 5 over 388m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Must be included in calculations. MISS SALLY LEA (7) failed to feature last start after being shuffled back early at The Gardens, but prior to that won by 2 lengths at The Gardens (23.13) beating Take The Zipper in a Grade 5 on October 16. The form out of her last race has been franked. Should be about the money. MUM'S ON FIRE (1) is a last-start placegetter at this track and distance - should be thereabouts.",
